  <section id="transport">
    <h2>Getting to the parks</h2>
    <p>This is one of the easier resorts for EPCOT and Hollywood Studios. You can walk to EPCOT through the International Gateway, or take a Friendship boat across Crescent Lake. Official water transportation listings support those boat routes from the Yacht and Beach Club area. The EPCOT Skyliner station is also a walk through the International Gateway. Buses cover Magic Kingdom, Animal Kingdom, the water parks and Disney Springs. Official pages say the Skyliner is closed January 24 through 30, 2027, and January 24 through February 2, 2028, with complimentary buses filling in.</p>
